Icons
-----

The metric icons are Octicons by GitHub, Inc., used under the MIT License.
The specific glyphs are star-16, history-16, git-pull-request-16, repo-16 and
issue-opened-16. See https://github.com/primer/octicons for the source and its
license text.

Language colors are GitHub's published language colors. They are adjusted for
contrast per surface before drawing, so a value may differ from the published one.
